      "hizbQuarter": 189,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4193,
      "text": "Your Lord says, “Call upon Me; I will respond to you. Those who are too proud to worship Me will enter Hell, utterly debased.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 474,
      "ruku": 409,
      "hizbQuarter": 189,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4194,
      "text": "It is Allah Who has made the night for you to rest therein and the day bright. Indeed, Allah is the Most Bountiful to people, but most people are ungrateful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 474,
      "ruku": 410,
      "hizbQuarter": 189,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4195,
      "text": "Such is Allah, your Lord, the Creator of everything; none has the right to be worshiped except Him. How are you then deluded?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 474,
      "ruku": 410,
      "hizbQuarter": 189,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4196,
      "text": "This is how those who rejected Allah’s signs were deluded.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 63,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 474,
      "ruku": 410,
      "hizbQuarter": 189,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4197,
      "text": "It is Allah Who has made the earth a dwelling place for you and the sky a canopy. He shaped you and perfected your form, and provided you with good things. Such is Allah, your Lord; Blessed is Allah, Lord of the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 64,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 474,
      "ruku": 410,
      "hizbQuarter": 189,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4198,
      "text": "He is the Ever-Living[14]; none has the right to be worshiped except Him. So call upon Him with sincere devotion to Him. All praise be to Allah, the Lord of the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 474,
      "ruku": 410,
      "hizbQuarter": 189,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4199,
      "text": "Say [O Prophet], “I have been forbidden to worship those whom you worship besides Allah since the clear proofs have come to me from my Lord, and I have been commanded to submit to the Lord of the worlds.”",
      "surah": {
